WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.270
<b>The Forest</b>

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.270
What's the matter?

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.020
Takkun won't pay attention to me.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.610
He's acting kinda cold.

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:11.820
It'll be fine.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:16.380
All boys his age act the 
opposite of the way they feel.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:17.710
Really?

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:22.250
Well, it's true he's got some 
good points, but he's still a kid.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.620
Oh, Kawabata-kun!

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.080
Here's a gift.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.130
Thanks!

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:30.760
I know! How about giving him 
a present of some sort?

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.370
A present?

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.060
A present...

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.850
Takkun, take me!

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:38.880
I'm a present!

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.390
Treat me nice!

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:43.850
Muromi-san, someone gave you 
a weird idea again, didn't they?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.960
<b>Sunk...</b>

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.230
Sunk...

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.520
<b>Quick.</b>

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:49.520
That was quick!

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:00.650
<b>Muromi-san on the Shore</b>

00:00:56.340 --> 00:01:00.650
<b>Episode 8
"Muromi-san and the Nice(?) Type"</b>

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.000
<b>A certain place in the Antarctic</b>

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.400
Save me, Buddha!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.160
Damn it...

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:11.270
<b>No frame-by-frame allowed!!</b>

00:03:19.310 --> 00:03:23.110
Curses! It's not fair to attack in numbers!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.680
You guys all just surrounded me!

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:28.260
Just do whatever you want!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:32.060
I'm going to be laid to waste in 
the sea through penguins.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:34.670
<i>More specifically, I'm going to 
be turned into penguin poop,</i>

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.390
<i>break down in the 
seawater, and disappear!</i>

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:38.410
<i>Even more specifically...</i>

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.560
<i>I'm going to turn into</i>

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.360
<i>the tastiest poop the sea has ever had!</i>

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:45.070
Muromi, what are you doing?

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.740
Levia-san?!

00:03:50.390 --> 00:03:52.830
Why are you even here?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.080
Weren't you supposed 
to be in Scandinavia?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:59.870
That was the plan, but I 
mixed up north and south.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:02.970
I don't want to go all the way 
to the other side of the Earth,

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.580
so I was going to sleep here,

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.990
and then I found you getting 
pecked by penguins.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.790
Are you trying to act like 
one of those monks

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.680
who offer themselves to starving beasts?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.890
I wouldn't try to imitate 
something so difficult.

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:16.730
Then you should hurry 
up and shoo them away.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.990
That hurts, doesn't it?

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:22.320
Yeah, but they come at me in 
groups and all I can do is cry.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:26.120
They're going to prey upon 
me no matter what I do.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.860
All you do is think about how 
you're gonna get bullied next.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:35.920
I guess I'll just have to 
warn the penguins for you.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:36.580
Huh?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.790
What?!

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.300
Penguins!

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.220
If you do something to hurt 
Muromi in the future...

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:50.530
I won't...

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.730
I won't forgive you!

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:09.590
Now you should be fine for a while.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.160
Muromi, you'd better learn 
to look after yourself.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:14.560
Thanks! I owe you one!

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:17.280
Anyway, I'm going to take a nap.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:17.830
Huh?

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.500
Wake me up if something happens.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:21.850
Good night.

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.970
Levia-san! Levia-san!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:26.760
That looks like a tasty fish.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.260
Why is there a polar 
bear in the Antarctic?!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:32.560
Could you do that one more time?

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.390
Muromi, I can't drink any more...

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:38.420
Okay, just one more glass.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.200
Levia-san!

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.940
Time to eat!

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:50.450
Muromi-san!

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:55.200
Huh?

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:57.510
There's a seal here?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:04.240
Maybe I should inform the 
TV station or something...

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.050
Or maybe not. I bet you're just waiting 
for Muromi-san, or something.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.630
Sigh...

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.690
Wait, I forget... is it okay to touch them?

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:15.470
I think they're protected by law or something.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.260
Hello?

00:06:20.260 --> 00:06:21.070
Who's this?

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:26.150
Oh, Takkun! I'm so happy 
you called! So what's up?

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.800
You know what's up!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.720
What are you going to do about this seal?

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:30.960
How long are you going to make him wait?!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.740
He's gonna start to attract crowds!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.310
A seal?

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.330
What are you talking about, Takkun?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.440
This seal.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:40.170
You're supposed to 
meet him here, right?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.470
Actually, where are you 
right now, Muromi-san?

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.470
Me?

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.710
I'm at Easter Island right now.

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.880
Easter Island?!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.390
Takkun is here.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.890
<b>Takkun is here.</b>

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.460
I'm here.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:54.880
<b>I'm here.</b>

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:54.830
So you're really not meeting 
up with this seal, then?

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.060
Nope.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:01.000
I thought Muromi-san brought 
you here like everyone else,

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.040
but I guess you just wandered in.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.760
Well, honestly, you don't look—

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.530
Takkun, you alive?!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:12.150
Looks like you haven't 
been eaten by the seal!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.800
What are you doing?

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.020
Why are you trying to get 
close to this human?

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:18.680
I'm glad I came rushing 
here at mach speed!

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:20.410
That wasn't just mach speed...

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.700
Then mech speed!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.730
You got here from a place with a 14-hour 
time difference in a second.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:25.830
Then mich speed!

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.130
You're just going through all the vowels!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.110
Why are you here?!

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.130
Well, I guess it's good you came.

00:07:33.130 --> 00:07:35.630
Now you can take him back 
to his normal habitat.

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:38.790
If you want me to, I can, but...

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.390
That might be a little difficult.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.690
Take a look.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:45.380
Animals always think of you 
as a fish, don't they?

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.610
Yeah.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:48.470
I don't know if this guy is from the

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:50.620
Sea of Okhotsk or the 
Bering Sea or wherever,

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:54.430
but I'm sure I'll have lost my 
lower half by the time I make it there.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.120
The tail was 
useless anyway!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.120
Zeong!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.870
Do you think you can try 
your best and get it done?

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:02.810
Then how about giving me something 
to help me do my best?

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:04.330
Like...

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.460
How about a kiss?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.170
You suck!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.680
This isn't even enough!

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:15.960
You're going to have to 
make this up to me later!

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:19.390
<b>A few days later</b>

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.830
Was it really that big of a struggle?

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:24.480
Muromi-san...

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:34.100
Coelacanth-san, let's go up to 
where there's sunlight.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.480
The weather's good.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.320
I'm scared of the surface.

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.220
Why?

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.450
It's fun in bright places, too.

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.560
I don't know why, but it's scary.

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:45.750
Hiichan!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:48.570
What are you doing? Let's go already.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:57.360
Canth...

00:08:48.890 --> 00:08:52.650
I wanted Coelacanth-san 
to hang out with us, too.

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.590
Are you trying to get more playmates 
than you can handle again?

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.190
So are you coming?

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:02.320
Scared, scared, scared...

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.020
Hey, Coelacanth-san! Wait!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.690
I said wait!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.060
He left...

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.530
It's because you made such a scary face!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.110
That was rude!

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:15.700
You could see happiness 
painted on my whole face!

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.670
Anyway, I wonder why he's so scared.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:25.230
I wanted to have fun with a living fossil.

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:29.380
Huh? A coelacanth?

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.980
Yes. I wonder why they don't 
come up to the surface.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:36.050
Muromi-san, you don't remember?

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.390
Huh? Me? It's my fault?

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:41.390
You did do something, didn't you?!

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.550
<b>A few hundred million years ago</b>

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.100
Do you remember that the coelacanth

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.960
tried to become land 
creatures a long time ago?

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:54.560
Oh, yeah. I remember 
we tried to help them.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:56.460
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:09:56.460 --> 00:10:02.370
Yeah, but right after that, you 
got your heart broken, right?

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:08.350
You need to do something about that habit 
of forgetting things that you don't like!

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:10.790
<i>Just a little bit...</i>

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:14.050
<i>Just a little bit more and 
I'll be able to breathe air.</i>

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:16.410
<b>Right after she 
got her heart broken</b>

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:21.390
<i>Why are you trying to 
get up onto land, too?!</i>

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:22.350
<i>Fish should...</i>

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:23.320
<i>Fish should...</i>

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.930
<i>...stay in the ocean!</i>

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.750
<i>That's the happiest place for them!</i>

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:30.380
<i>You shouldn't try to get on land!</i>

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.900
<i>Canth!</i>

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:33.070
<i>The bottom of the ocean 
is nice and calm!</i>

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:40.140
<i>The land is scary.</i>

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:41.740
<i>Scary, scary...</i>

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.200
<i>Something's scary.</i>

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:46.580
Oneetan...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.580
At the time I thought that anyone

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:51.900
trying to get up onto land had issues.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:53.910
I was pretty young back then.

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.880
So it was your fault!

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.800
You gave him trauma on a genetic level!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:03.960
You needlessly gave dolphins 
a bad rep until recently, too!

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.180
You haven't really changed, 
have you, Muromi-san?

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.680
Oneetan, take responsibility!

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.500
R-Responsibility?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:12.440
Responsibility, eh?

00:11:13.140 --> 00:11:17.110
Well, uh, the reason that 
I came today is...

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:21.230
The reason you guys are scared 
seems to be a bit of a misunderstanding...

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.170
You see...

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:23.820
The light is scary.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:26.250
You're scary, too.

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:28.060
The surface is scary.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:32.190
I don't know why everything's 
scary, but it is.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.540
Hey!

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:38.730
Scary!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.900
Scary, scary...

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:46.340
Scary for some reason.

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.970
Scary, scary...

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.470
How's everyone who's watching doing?

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:54.420
We're humanity's idols.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:54.960
Penguin...

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.050
...and Seal!

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.610
We can read the preview!

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.660
It is now our era!

00:11:58.660 --> 00:11:59.820
The time has come for us to soar!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.170
Not that I can soar, being a penguin.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:05.200
Next time:
"Muromi-san and the Secret Advanced Civilization"

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:02.910
See you again next week.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.660
Not that we'll be in the show again!
